# 🏞 Heavy game assets — this is the `code-only` mirror branch on the
# Mythicspellbook remote. All binary assets (sprites, audio, video, zips,
# JSON exports) are excluded so the repo stays under GitHub's 100MB-per-
# file limit. The actual assets ship to Cloudflare Workers as part of
# `npm run deploy`; they live in the local working tree, just not in git.
public/assets/
public/Boosterandpacks/
public/Exports/
public/Operations/
